msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_res_partner__cr_einvoice_checked
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_res_users__cr_einvoice_checked
msgid ""
"Set when the customer saved their electronic invoice data on the website and"
" Hacienda's registry confirmed it; cleared when Hacienda could not be "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"Se marca cuando el cliente guardó sus datos de factura electrónica en el "
"sitio y el registro de Hacienda los confirmó; se desmarca si Hacienda no "
"respondió."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_sale_order__cr_einvoice_choice_made
msgid ""
"Technical: the customer chose explicitly, so a new billing address keeps "
"their choice."
msgstr ""
"Técnico: el cliente eligió explícitamente, así que una nueva dirección de "
"facturación mantiene su elección."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_sale_order__cr_einvoice_requested
msgid ""
"The customer asked for an electronic invoice (FE), in their name or a third "
"party's. Otherwise the order is invoiced with an electronic ticket (TE)."
msgstr ""
"El cliente pidió factura electrónica (FE), a su nombre o de un tercero. Si "
"no, el pedido se factura con tiquete electrónico (TE)."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_sale_order__cr_einvoice_verified
msgid ""
"The customer's identification was confirmed by Hacienda's registry, or is a "
"company's data kept by the sales team. If not, check it before invoicing, "
"then tick this box."
msgstr ""
"La identificación del cliente la confirmó el registro de Hacienda, o son "
"datos de una empresa que mantiene el equipo de ventas. Si no, revisarla "
"antes de facturar y marcar esta casilla."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/cr_website_sale_einvoice/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"The identification number must have %(lengths)s digits, with no leading "
"zero, dashes or spaces."
msgstr ""
"El número de identificación debe tener %(lengths)s dígitos, sin cero al "
"inicio, guiones ni espacios."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:cr_website_sale_einvoice.einvoice_form
msgid ""
"The name and economic activity are taken from Hacienda's registry. Sent to"
msgstr ""
"El nombre y la actividad económica se toman del registro de Hacienda. Se "
"envía a"

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/cr_website_sale_einvoice/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The phone number must have 8 digits."
msgstr "El número de teléfono debe tener 8 dígitos."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_res_partner__cr_einvoice_requested_by_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cr_website_sale_einvoice.field_res_users__cr_einvoice_requested_by_id
msgid ""
"The website customer who asked for electronic invoices in this partner's "
"name (a third party)."
msgstr ""
"El cliente del sitio que pidió facturas electrónicas a nombre de este "
"contacto (un tercero)."

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:cr_website_sale_einvoice.einvoice_form
msgid "Third party's e-mail to receive the invoice"
msgstr "Correo del tercero para recibir la factura"

#. module: cr_website_sale_einvoice
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:cr_website_sale_einvoice.einvoice_form
